import BentSum.Congruence
import BentSum.Counterexample
import BentSum.Derivative

/-!
# Counterexamples to the bent-sum and derivative conjectures

* `BentSum.IsBentSum.two_pow_dvd_wt`: the weight congruence for sums of two bent
  functions;
* `BentSum.not_bentSumConjecture`: the bent-sum conjecture fails in every even
  dimension `2m ≥ 8`;
* `BentSum.not_derivativeConjecture`: the derivative conjecture fails in every
  even dimension `2 + 2q ≥ 10`.
-/
